# `endofweek` overflowing the 64-bit microsecond datetime range is DS4003.
mode: run
---- query
from '../../../data/orders.csv'
| take 1
| project w = endofweek(timestamp, 20000000)
---- expected
error[DS4003]: the result of `endofweek` does not fit in a `datetime`
  --> query:3:15
  |
3 | | project w = endofweek(timestamp, 20000000)
  |               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ this overflowed
  |
  = note: datetimes and timespans are counted in microseconds and hold about ±292,000 years
